                "caption": "Figure 2:Overview of the recipe. (1) GSPO on the prompts of one domain turns Qwen3.5-9B into the teacher of that domain, directly or after an SFT warm-up on the traces of the domain. (2) MOPD distills the domain teachers into one student that starts from Qwen3.5-9B, on the union of the prompts. (3) MixRL continues the MOPD student on the same prompts and gives the main model, M3OPD-Reasoner-9B. The baselines train one model on the mixed data with MixRL, after MixSFT or directly from Qwen3.5-9B, without teachers or MOPD.",
